// Generic String :
"P1212531025" "Sic Sempre Tyrannis"
// Generic String :
"P3282363411" "Approach"
// Generic String :
"P2148775081" "Approach the Magisterium plaza, defeating Imperial Defense Forces as you close on your target."
// Generic String :
"P1657121715" "<t=5 caption x=0.3 y=0.2 d=4><scale 1.75><color Black><bgcolor DarkGoldenrod>Dream Doctor's thoughts echo throughout this astral conduit: <t=5 caption x=0.7 y=0.2 d=4><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor Black> $name, this is it - our best chance to sever Tyrant's connection to the well!<t=5 caption x=0.7 y=0.2 d=4><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor Black>The Dagger of Jocas would have been perfect for this, but I don't want to risk linking Cole to Rularuu...<t=5 caption x=0.7 y=0.2 d=4><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor Black>We'll just have to find another way to fight him.  Good thing you're so adept at thinking on your feet!<t=4 caption x=0.7 y=0.2 d=3><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor Black>Er... you do have feet... don't you?"
// Generic String :
"P617005977" "<t=5 caption x= 0.7 y=0.2 d=4><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor Black>Step through this portal to connect this astral conduit directly to the Magisterium!<t=5 caption x= 0.7 y=0.2 d=4><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor Black>If anyone damages you so badly that your soul leaves your body, I'll intercept it and bring it here, instead."
// Say String :
"P1801072254" "<color Red><bgcolor Black>Finally! Took you long enough, Doc!"
// Generic String :
"P3738701450" "<t=4 x=0.2 y=0.2 d=4.5><scale 1.75><color Red><bgcolor Black>Finally! Took you long enough, Doc!"
// Generic String :
"P1070894632" "<color White><bgcolor Black>Yes, yes. Hurry, Ms. Duncan. There isn't much time."
// Generic String :
"P95392504" "<t=4 x=0.7 y=0.2 d=4.5><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor Black>Yes, yes. Hurry, Ms. Duncan. There isn't much time."
// Say String :
"P1741239775" "<color Red><bgcolor Black>Ah, there's Desdemona."
// Say String :
"P2064709971" "<face=NPC-Desdemona>"
// Generic String :
"P2619776997" "<t=3 x=0.2 y=0.2 d=3.5><scale 1.75><color Red><bgcolor Black>Ah, there's Desdemona."
// Say String :
"P4051650818" "<color Goldenrod><bgcolor Black>Megan, you're here! And I see the Incarnates have joined you! You have good timing. I don't think we have much more fight within us."
// Generic String :
"P3081885557" "<t=5 x=0.7 y=0.2 d=6><scale 1.75><color Goldenrod><bgcolor Black>Megan, you're here! And I see the Incarnates have joined you! You have good timing. I don't think we have much more fight within us."
// Generic String :
"P3286848768" "<t=5 x=0.7 y=0.4 d=6><scale 1.75><color Mahogany><bgcolor Red>We may be surrounded, sisters, but we must fight on until the Tyrant is destroyed!"
// Generic String :
"P2992214520" "<t=5 x=0.2 y=0.4 d=6><scale 1.75><color Crimson><bgcolor Grey>Steady men! We have these monsters surrounded. Then we finish with the Resistance!"
// Generic String :
"P4030291447" "<t=5 x=0.45 y=0.4 d=6><scale 1.75><color Black><bgcolor Goldenrod>Warriors of the Carnival, Mistress Desdemona has sounded the the retreat! Fall back at once!"
// Generic String :
"P3684485968" "<t=5 x=0.2 y=0.4 d=6><scale 1.75><color Crimson><bgcolor Grey>We have the remaining Talons targeted, sir! Commencing bombardment!"
// Generic String :
"P3843244126" "<t=5 x=0.7 y=0.4 d=6><scale 1.75><color Mahogany><bgcolor Red>This... is not over... We will... return!"
// Say String :
"P263357285" "<color LightSkyBlue><bgcolor Navy>We are routed, Desdemona. I know you want to remain, but please, leave this to the Incarnates. We must fall back and save all we can."
// Generic String :
"P3665983195" "<t=5 x=0.2 y=0.2 d=6><scale 1.75><color LightSkyBlue><bgcolor Navy>We are routed, Desdemona. I know you want to remain, but please, leave this to the Incarnates. We must fall back and save all we can."
// Say String :
"P3674867555" "<color Goldenrod><bgcolor Black>Yes, Aurora. There's nothing we can achieve here any longer. Come, Megan... we need to get everyone out of here. It is in the Incarnates' hands now."
// Generic String :
"P171587691" "<t=5 x=0.7 y=0.2 d=6><scale 1.75><color Goldenrod><bgcolor Black>Yes, Aurora. There's nothing we can achieve here any longer. Come, Megan... we need to get everyone out of here. It is in the Incarnates' hands now."
// Generic String :
"P2307897934" "<t=5 x=0.2 y=0.4 d=6><scale 1.75><color Crimson><bgcolor Grey>The Talons are eliminated and the Carnival is in retreat. Sending all remaining reinforcements to the Magisterium now to deal with the Incarnates."
