"P430337563" "Black Swan is approaching from Shadow Earth.  Ready yourselves for her assault!"
// Generic String :
"P1478050008" "<t=4 caption x=0.2 y=0.2 d=5><scale 1.75><color Black><bgcolor DarkGoldenrod>A wicked laugh echoes across the Magisterium. It is Black Swan.<t=4 caption x=0.2 y=0.2 d=5><scale 1.75><color #FEFEFF><bgcolor #0F0F1F>Think it will be just that easy, do you?<t=5 caption x=0.3 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color #FEFEFF><bgcolor #0F0F1F>Those fools were a distraction while I prepared a little surprise for you.<t=3 caption x=0.7 y=0.2 d=4><scale 1.75><color #FEFEFF><bgcolor #0F0F1F>You may think you are strong now, Incarnates.<t=5 caption x=0.6 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color #FEFEFF><bgcolor #0F0F1F>But, when I have claimed your power through the Quills of Jocas, you will be nothing. <t=5 caption x=0.5 y=0.4 d=6><scale 1.75><color #FEFEFF><bgcolor #0F0F1F>I will crush the life out of you with your own power."
// Generic String :
